You: That was a terrible disaster. More than 1,500 people died.
Companion: It's hard to believe it really happened. And we know what's going to happen.
You: Maybe we can use our new time travel device.
Companion: If only we could warn them. You don't seriously mean...?
You: I'm going. Let's do this.
Companion: You want to go back to Titanic? Okay. I'll stay here and help you from this side.
Companion: First, sit down at the terminal. We have to calibrate the coordinates!